  chapters:
  - chapterName: Chapter I
    tasks:
    - Use your "MOUSE" to look around.
    - Press "WASD" to move around.
    - Press "LSHIFT" to sprint
    - Talk to Maria.
    - Press "F" to pray and regain your sanity.
    - Find something to light your way.
    - Search the desk to find anything useful.
    - Head towards the village.
    - Investigate the chapel.
    - Examine the chapel for signs of the priest.
    - Gather clues left behind.
    - Gather clues left behind.
    - "Enter the priest\u2019s quarters."
    - "Search the priest\u2019s room for anything unusual."
    - Unlock the passage inside the quarters.
    - Enter the secret passage.
